<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells 500,000 lbs of nickel.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells 500,000 lbs of nickel.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said it sold 500,000 lbs of nickel for $1,724,598 to two companies.</p>
<p>Allied Deals bought 40,000 lbs at $3.4673 per lb, and 40,000 lbs at $3.4573 per lb.</p>
<p>Considar bought 420,000 lbs at $3.4467 per lb.</p>
<p>The next offer of Stockpile nickel is June 12.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
